data_mose2
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [mose2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# 2H-MoSe2 (P6_3/mmc): Bronsema, Z. Anorg. Allg. Chem. 540/541, 15--17
# (1986), doi:10.1002/zaac.19865400904. The single-crystal refinement gives
# a=3.289(1), c=12.927(4) A and Se 4f z=0.6210(3). Mo occupies symmetry-fixed
# Wyckoff 2c (1/3,2/3,1/4); the P1 basis below expands those reported sites.
# The Se offset delta = |0.75 - 0.621| = 0.129 from its Mo plane gives the
# refined Mo-Se bond length 2.53 A:
# sqrt((a/sqrt(3))^2 + (0.129 c)^2) = 2.53 A.
# (The previous basis used delta = 0.121 from a misread of the 4f convention.)
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.289
_cell_length_b 3.289
_cell_length_c 12.927
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
